      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The Pi extension injects the using-superpowers bootstrap into provider context as a user-role message on session startup and after compaction, with Pi-specific tool mapping, so agents get Superpowers skill context in Pi sessions; injection is pending-marked on session_start/session_compact, inserted after leading compactionSummary messages, and cleared on agent_end to avoid duplication."
